                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Professor Li is one of the best professor I have had at UW. I've taken two of her classes, even though I don't specialize in Chinese art history. She is so knowledgable and every lecture is a treat!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
